.SH "نام (NAME)"
lr_environment \- Export Lire configuration in shell script form
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
eval \`\fBlr_environment\fR\`
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
The \fBlr_environment\fR command is used to import the Lire configuration
in Lire shell scripts.
.PP
All of Lire configuration variables will be written in a format that
can be evaled by the shell.
.PP
Shell scripts don\*(Aqt usually have to use that command, since it is done
by the \fIdefaults\fR file sourced by each command.
.PP
The old names used by when the configuration was done in shell script
are also exported by this script for backward compatibility.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
